# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
**/target/
**/dist/
**/static/
!docs/static/
!docs/static/**
!docs/themes/easydocs/static/
!docs/themes/easydocs/static/**
**/server/qdrant/
**/.fastembed_cache/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

kimun.app
docs/book/
**/.claude/
**/.superpowers/
.agents/
docs/superpowers/
docs/plans/
docs/specs/
memory/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
*.sqlite
*.kimuncache
tui/kimun_config.toml
/test_config.toml
docs/public/
.worktrees/
example/*/kimun.sqlite
# Per-vault runtime state (vault-id, locks, caches) is machine-local.
# `saved-searches.toml` is demo content, so the entries are ignored
# rather than the directory — a file under an excluded directory
# cannot be re-included.
example/*/.kimun/*
!example/*/.kimun/saved-searches.toml
example/history/
openspec/
adr/
handoff/
plan/
plans/
